====Usage notes====
* {{m|de||Frikadelle}} is the most widely accepted word for this dish in German. It is nevertheless regionally bound and heard most often in central-western and north-western Germany.
* The typically German way of preparing see at {{m|en|frikadelle}}. The word is not restricted to this particular recipe, however.

